lt_kirciai.tsv - Lithuanian stress dictionary (word, vowel group index, pitch accent mark,
                 optional IPA vowel group index where espeak-ng splits a diphthong).
lt_raides.tsv  - letter names espeak-ng gets wrong when a word is spelled out
                 (own work, GPL-3.0 like the rest of piper1-gpl).

Built from two CC-BY-4.0 sources:
  https://huggingface.co/datasets/meldynamics/liepa-tts   LIEPA corpus annotation (Vilnius University)
  https://github.com/svogunas/g2p-lt-lexicon               pronunciation lexicon (Arunas Smaliukas)

Build script and manual corrections: https://github.com/RobertasTa/reginute (sudaryk_zodyna.py)
